"""Paper-specific reasoning for internal Q01–Q25; local evidence remains separate."""
SUPPORT = {1: {'refs': [13, 5], 'locator': 'Tan et al. [13], §3.3 Datasets and Evaluation Metrics; iTransformer [5], Appendix A.1.', 'en': 'Tan et al. explicitly use 70/10/20 for Illness [13, §3.3], while iTransformer preserves chronological separation [5, App. A.1]. These provide a concrete forecasting precedent: retain enough training data, use validation for model selection, and reserve later observations for the final test. The exact 676/97/193 integers come from our 966 rows and rounding rule. The literature supports the design rationale; it does not prove that this ratio is optimal for every influenza season or that our upstream file identity is established.', 'zh': 'Tan 等明确对 Illness 使用 70/10/20 [13，第 3.3 节]，iTransformer 则保持按时间分离 [5，附录 A.1]。这是具体的预测研究先例：保留较多训练数据，以验证集选模，再用较晚观测做最终测试。676/97/193 的精确整数来自本项目 966 行及取整规则。文献支持设计理由，但不证明该比例对所有流感季最优，也不能证明本地文件与上游身份一致。', 'oral_en': 'The split follows an Illness precedent in Tan et al.; chronological separation protects the final evaluation [13, 5].', 'oral_zh': '这个划分有 Tan 等 Illness 实验的先例，时间分离用于保护最终评价 [13, 5]。'}, 2: {'refs': [13], 'locator': 'Tan et al. [13], §3.1 Reproducibility Note; local eval_windows.py.', 'en': 'Tan et al. retain original data-loaders and training conditions during their reproduction checks [13, §3.1]. This supports disclosing exactly which examples are scored; it does not require cropping. Our complete-batch rule changes the scoring population. Giving every model the same retained windows removes a comparison unfairness, but deleting the tail can still alter the result. The necessary sensitivity analysis is to score every model on all available windows and compare rankings. A literature citation cannot establish our discarded-tail difficulty without its raw calculation.', 'zh': 'Tan 等复核时保留原数据加载器与训练条件 [13，第 3.1 节]，说明必须交代哪些样本进入计分，却不表示论文要求裁剪。本地完整批量规则改变了计分样本。各模型采用相同保留窗口，可消除比较不公平，但删去尾部仍可能改变结果。必要的敏感性分析是让所有模型在完整窗口重评分，再比较排名。文献不能代替被删尾部难度的原始计算。', 'oral_en': 'Cropping preserves a shared scoring population; full-window rescoring tests its effect [13].', 'oral_zh': '裁剪用于统一计分样本，完整窗口重评分用于检验裁剪影响 [13]。'}, 3: {'refs': [22], 'locator': 'Kapoor and Narayanan [22], Results, leakage taxonomy L1 and L1.2.', 'en': 'Kapoor and Narayanan identify preprocessing across the training/test boundary as a leakage route [22, L1.2]. Here that means fitting channel means and standard deviations only on training, then reusing them. If future observations determine these constants, preparation has already adapted to the held-out distribution even without using test labels in gradient updates. This makes train-only scaling part of the experiment. The separate local file-equality check establishes matching inputs, not absence of every possible leakage route.', 'zh': 'Kapoor 与 Narayanan 把跨越训练/测试边界的预处理列为泄漏路径 [22，L1.2]。用于这里，就是只在训练段拟合各通道均值和标准差，再原样复用。如果未来观测决定这些常数，预处理已适应留出分布，即使梯度更新没有使用测试标签。因此训练段标准化属于实验设计。本地文件相等检查则只证明输入一致，不能证明所有泄漏路径均不存在。', 'oral_en': 'Preprocessing is fitted on training only, following the leakage distinction in Kapoor and Narayanan [22].', 'oral_zh': '依照 Kapoor 与 Narayanan 对泄漏的区分，预处理只在训练段拟合 [22]。'}, 4: {'refs': [3, 5, 19], 'locator': 'PatchTST [3], Appendix A.6.1; iTransformer [5], Appendix A.2 and Table 5; Bouthillier et al. [19], Appendix C.3.', 'en': 'The original three-seed citation is incorrect. PatchTST uses fixed-seed main results plus a five-seed supervised robustness check [3, App. A.6.1]; iTransformer reports five-run standard deviations [5, App. A.2, Table 5]. Neither passage establishes three seeds as their shared convention. Our choice is a compute compromise. Bouthillier et al. distinguish repeated-run precision from broader benchmark variation [19]. Extra seeds can improve the former; extra seasons/origins address different uncertainty. Ten reproduction repetitions do not make the separate three-seed benchmark equally precise.', 'zh': '原来的三种子引用不正确。PatchTST 的主结果采用固定种子，另做五种子监督稳健性检查 [3，附录 A.6.1]；iTransformer 报告五次运行的标准差 [5，附录 A.2 表 5]。这些段落不能证明三种子是两文共同惯例。我们的选择属于算力折衷。Bouthillier 等区分重复运行精度和更广的基准变异 [19]：增加种子可改善前者，增加季节/原点处理另一类不确定性。十次复现不会让独立的三种子基准同样精确。', 'oral_en': 'Three seeds are our compute compromise. Both cited papers provide five-seed robustness evidence, motivating stronger checks [3, 5].', 'oral_zh': '三种子是算力折衷；两篇所引论文实际提供五种子稳健性证据，提示仍需加强检查 [3, 5]。'}, 5: {'refs': [22], 'locator': 'Kapoor and Narayanan [22], taxonomy L1, clean separation through modelling and evaluation.', 'en': 'A checkpoint is a model-selection choice. Selecting it by test error uses the final evaluation to fit that choice, contrary to clean separation [22, L1]. This justifies our validation-selected checkpoint independently of whether a particular upstream bug can be proved. Scoring all seven declared channels is a separate metric-consistency issue. Neither principle proves Moon et al. committed the alleged defects or that exactly two changes caused our gap. Causal attribution needs matched runs changing checkpoint selection, loader or another factor one at a time.', 'zh': '检查点属于选模选择；按测试误差挑选，就是用最终评价拟合该选择，不符合干净分离 [22，L1]。不论上游缺陷是否能证实，这个原则都支持本地验证集选检查点。按声明的七通道计分则是另一项指标一致性问题。这些原则不能证明 Moon 等犯了所指缺陷，也不能证明差距仅由两项改变造成。因果归因需要配对运行，每次只改变检查点、加载器或另一项因素。', 'oral_en': 'Validation selection protects the held-out test; upstream defect attribution is a separate evidence question [22].', 'oral_zh': '验证集选模保护留出测试；上游是否有缺陷，须另有证据 [22]。'}, 6: {'refs': [21, 2], 'locator': 'Hyndman and Koehler [21], §2.1; Kramer and Shaman [2], Forecast accuracy and comparison.', 'en': 'Hyndman and Koehler explain why measurement scale matters [21, §2.1]; Kramer and Shaman define peaks on an observed disease series [2]. Our standardised aggregate divides each channel’s squared error in original units by its training variance. The result is a dimensionless loss, not a patient-count curve with one inverse scaler. For peaks, inverse-transform ILITOTAL predictions and observations first, then locate peaks. Taking a peak of the seven-channel loss would answer a different question. Literature motivates an interpretable endpoint; ILITOTAL is our explicit operational choice.', 'zh': 'Hyndman 与 Koehler 解释尺度为何重要 [21，第 2.1 节]；Kramer 与 Shaman 在观测疾病序列上定义峰值 [2]。本项目标准化总体损失将各通道原单位平方误差除以训练方差，所得是无量纲损失，而非可用一组参数反变换的患者人数曲线。峰值评测应先反变换 ILITOTAL 预测和观测，再找峰；对七通道损失找峰会回答另一个问题。文献支持可解释端点，ILITOTAL 是明确的项目选择。', 'oral_en': 'Overall standardised error and an interpretable disease peak are different endpoints [21, 2].', 'oral_zh': '标准化整体误差与可解释疾病峰值，是不同端点 [21, 2]。'}, 7: {'refs': [19], 'locator': 'Bouthillier et al. [19], §§2–3, benchmark estimators and sources of variation.', 'en': 'Bouthillier et al. show that benchmark estimates depend on the sampled learning pipeline [19]. A mean is therefore an estimate over specified runs, not an immutable property of a model name. Our two MIFlu estimates summarise separate seed sets and serve different comparisons. The gap could combine seed variability with configuration differences; it does not isolate one cause. Explain each table’s run definition first, then request matched run-level configurations if the cause of the difference matters.', 'zh': 'Bouthillier 等说明基准估计取决于被抽样的学习流程 [19]。均值是指定运行集合的估计，不是模型名称自带的不变属性。两项 MIFlu 估计汇总不同种子集合，服务不同对照。差值可能同时包含种子波动与配置差异，不能分离某一原因。应先解释两表运行定义；若关心成因，再取回匹配的逐运行配置。', 'oral_en': 'They estimate separate run sets; the difference is not a controlled effect of one change [19].', 'oral_zh': '两数估计不同运行集合，不能把差值视为一项改变的受控效果 [19]。'}, 8: {'refs': [21], 'locator': 'Hyndman and Koehler [21], §2.1, MSE/MAE and sensitivity to large residuals.', 'en': 'The paper distinguishes squared and absolute errors and their sensitivity to large residuals [21]. As an algebraic illustration, not an observed run, doubling a residual doubles its absolute contribution but quadruples its squared contribution. A changed residual distribution can thus move MSE and MAE differently. Our CSV determines the actual horizon signs; the literature explains why different signs are possible. Per-channel and per-window residuals, rather than this general principle alone, are needed to identify the actual errors behind the gap.', 'zh': '该文区分平方与绝对误差，以及两者对大残差的敏感性 [21]。作代数示例而非实测：残差翻倍，绝对贡献变两倍，平方贡献变四倍。因此残差分布改变时，MSE 与 MAE 可以不同向。CSV 确定实际逐跨度符号，文献解释为何可能不同。若要确定哪些误差造成差距，仍需逐通道、逐窗口残差，不能只靠一般原理。', 'oral_en': 'MSE weights large residuals more strongly than MAE, so the horizon signs must be read separately [21].', 'oral_zh': 'MSE 更重视大残差，逐跨度方向必须与 MAE 分开读取 [21]。'}, 9: {'refs': [19, 22], 'locator': 'Bouthillier et al. [19], variance analysis; Kapoor and Narayanan [22], model info sheets.', 'en': 'Repeated-run estimates and traceable evaluation address different weaknesses [19, 22]. The oracle checks the arithmetic of a transcribed record; saved predictions would check whether the pipeline produced it. The practical chain is run configuration → prediction → scoring code → cell → aggregate. A benchmark plot is another summary and cannot establish a ten-seed reproduction trajectory. Missing links limit the claim even when the mean is close. The imported panels remain useful illustrations if their true provenance is stated.', 'zh': '重复运行估计与可追溯评测处理不同缺口 [19, 22]。oracle 核对转录记录的算术，保存预测才可核对流程是否产生该记录。实际链条是运行配置 → 预测 → 计分代码 → 单元 → 聚合。基准图是另一种摘要，不能建立十种子复现轨迹。即使均值接近，链条缺项仍限制主张；只要说明真实来源，沿用曲线仍可作示例。', 'oral_en': 'The oracle establishes arithmetic; raw outputs establish provenance. Both evidence levels matter [19, 22].', 'oral_zh': 'oracle 建立算术证据，原始输出建立来源证据，两者都重要 [19, 22]。'}, 10: {'refs': [4, 3, 5, 7, 8], 'locator': 'Zeng et al. [4], §4; PatchTST [3], §3.1; iTransformer [5], §3; CALF [7] and TimeCMA [8], author abstracts.', 'en': 'The families test different explanations: simple temporal mapping [4], patches and inverted variable tokens [3, 5], and explicit cross-modal alignment [7, 8]. This motivates diverse controls, not a claim that 28 is an optimal count. It also makes implementation fidelity important: a named adaptation may omit a paper’s decisive alignment or training component. DLinear is a relevant simple control in this literature. Its appearance in the source paper is not itself a scientific reason to omit it from a sensitivity analysis.', 'zh': '各家族检验不同解释：简单时间映射 [4]、patch 与反转变量词元 [3, 5]，以及明确的跨模态对齐 [7, 8]。这支持采用多样对照，不证明 28 是最优数量，也使实现忠实度很重要：同名适配可能省略原文关键对齐或训练组件。DLinear 是这条文献中的相关简单对照；它曾出现在原论文，本身不是在敏感性分析中省略它的科学理由。', 'oral_en': 'The papers motivate different controls; the exports determine which models each analysis actually covers [3–5, 7, 8].', 'oral_zh': '论文支持选择不同对照；导出文件决定每项分析实际覆盖哪些模型 [3–5, 7, 8]。'}, 11: {'refs': [2, 18], 'locator': 'Kramer and Shaman [2], Forecast accuracy and comparison; Bracher et al. [18], §§3–4.', 'en': 'Peak timing/intensity are disease-specific endpoints [2], while interval scoring evaluates predictive uncertainty [18]. A seven-channel point-error ranking supplies neither automatically. Separate observed accuracy, peak trade-offs and operational cost. NLinear’s lower height error does not erase its worse mean timing; MIFlu’s lowest MSE does not establish calibrated intervals or prospective benefit. This lets us defend an evidence-based selection process before claiming a public-health deployment winner.', 'zh': '峰值时间/强度是疾病领域端点 [2]，区间评分考查预测不确定性 [18]；七通道点误差排名不会自动提供这些证据。应分别看观测精度、峰值取舍与操作代价。NLinear 峰高误差低不能抹去平均时间误差更大；MIFlu 的 MSE 最低也不证明区间校准或前瞻效益。我们因此可先论证选模证据，再谈公共卫生部署赢家。', 'oral_en': 'MIFlu wins the observed point-error ranking; peak endpoints and uncertainty need their own evidence [2, 18].', 'oral_zh': 'MIFlu 赢的是观测点误差排名，峰值端点与不确定性须有各自证据 [2, 18]。'}, 12: {'refs': [2], 'locator': 'Kramer and Shaman [2], Forecast accuracy and comparison, separate timing/intensity tolerances.', 'en': 'The separate literature endpoints motivate inspecting timing and height before reducing them to a pass count [2]. Our equal four-pass counts hide different lead/horizon locations and distances from the thresholds. An application emphasising one-week-ahead height could favour a different trade-off from an application emphasising timing. That conditional interpretation comes from our table, not from a literature recommendation of NLinear. A binary pass is a coarse summary of continuous errors.', 'zh': '文献分开评价时间与强度，支持先看两项误差，再压缩为通过数 [2]。相同四次通过隐藏不同步长/跨度位置，以及距阈值多远的差别。优先重视提前一周峰高的应用，可能与重视时间的应用选择不同取舍。这是对本地表格的条件式解释，不是文献推荐 NLinear。二元通过标签只是连续误差的粗略摘要。', 'oral_en': 'Equal counts conceal different cells and a timing–height trade-off [2].', 'oral_zh': '相同通过数隐藏不同位置与时间—峰高取舍 [2]。'}, 13: {'refs': [2, 18], 'locator': 'Kramer and Shaman [2], Forecast accuracy and comparison / Fig. 2; Bracher et al. [18], §4.2.', 'en': 'Kramer and Shaman evaluate forecast-level peak accuracy by lead time [2]. Our sixteen configuration cells have a different denominator. Applying a threshold to an average is mathematically different from averaging event-level pass indicators. Thus 4/16 cannot be relabelled as season success probability. Bracher et al. discuss calibration of predictive distributions [18, §4.2]; small peak-height error does not establish it. Estimating event success requires retaining individual outcomes, defining the event denominator and accounting for dependence.', 'zh': 'Kramer 与 Shaman 按提前时间评价逐预测峰值准确性 [2]，我们的十六个配置单元是另一种分母。对均值应用阈值，与对逐事件通过指示值取平均，在数学上不同，所以 4/16 不能改名为流行季成功概率。Bracher 等讨论预测分布校准 [18，第 4.2 节]，峰高误差小不等于已校准。估计事件成功率需保留逐事件结果、定义事件分母并处理依赖。', 'oral_en': 'Our denominator counts configurations after averaging, not successful seasons or calibrated probabilities [2, 18].', 'oral_zh': '这里数的是平均后的配置，而非成功流行季或经校准概率 [2, 18]。'}, 14: {'refs': [4, 21], 'locator': 'Zeng et al. [4], §4 NLinear; Hyndman and Koehler [21], §2.1.', 'en': 'Zeng et al. describe NLinear’s last-value subtraction, linear map and addition back [4]. This gives a testable hypothesis about level handling, not a proven explanation for our peaks. The ranking mismatch itself follows a simpler distinction: MSE aggregates many points and seven channels, whereas PIE concentrates on detected ILITOTAL peak height [21 gives the error-measure context]. A model can improve many non-peak points yet worsen this endpoint. Controlled variants and peak/residual diagnostics are needed to attribute the observed trade-off to architecture.', 'zh': 'Zeng 等说明 NLinear 先减最后一个值，经过线性映射，再加回该值 [4]。这提供水平处理的可检验假设，却非本地峰值成因的证明。排名差别有更直接的区别：MSE 聚合许多点和七通道，PIE 聚焦 ILITOTAL 检测峰高 [21 提供误差指标背景]。模型可能改善非峰点却使该端点较差。若要归因于架构，须有受控变体和峰值/残差诊断。', 'oral_en': 'The objectives aggregate different errors; NLinear’s level correction is a hypothesis to test [4, 21].', 'oral_zh': '两种目标聚合不同误差，NLinear 水平校正是待检验的假设 [4, 21]。'}, 15: {'refs': [5], 'locator': 'iTransformer [5], Appendix D Model Efficiency; local BENCH_EFFICIENCY.csv.', 'en': 'iTransformer evaluates error alongside speed and memory [5, App. D], a precedent for considering performance with cost. Our cost axis is narrower: exported parameters. The two local frontier members follow from pairwise dominance in the eleven-model subset, not a paper’s recommendation of a universal winner. A Pareto graph removes dominated choices; the remaining choices still need a budget or acceptable-error preference. Missing MIFlu cost data prevents calling it the frontier of all 28 models.', 'zh': 'iTransformer 同时评价误差、速度和内存 [5，附录 D]，是把表现与代价并列考虑的先例。我们的代价轴更窄，只用导出参数。两个前沿成员来自十一模型子集的两两支配关系，并非论文推荐的通用赢家。Pareto 图排除被支配选择；余下选择仍需预算或可接受误差偏好。MIFlu 代价缺失，使它不能称为全部 28 模型前沿。', 'oral_en': 'The frontier removes dominated choices within the measured subset; a decision preference still chooses among them [5].', 'oral_zh': '前沿排除所测子集内的被支配选择，仍需决策偏好从中选模 [5]。'}, 16: {'refs': [5], 'locator': 'iTransformer [5], Appendix D, Fig. 10, matched speed/memory measurements.', 'en': 'iTransformer measures speed and memory under stated input/prediction lengths and the same batch size [5, App. D]. Our parameter export does not supply those measurements. Parameters affect storage; operations, token counts and hardware utilisation affect elapsed time differently. Consequently 211× parameters cannot imply 211× latency, memory or energy. A useful next efficiency table records hardware, precision, batch size and whether training or inference is timed. These fields cannot be invented from the parameter ratio.', 'zh': 'iTransformer 在声明的输入/预测长度和统一批量下实测速度、内存 [5，附录 D]，我们的参数导出没有这些测量。参数影响存储，运算、词元数量与硬件利用率对耗时影响不同。因此参数多 211×，不能推出延迟、内存或能耗也多 211×。后续效率表应记录硬件、精度、批量，以及计时针对训练还是推理，不能用参数比猜这些字段。', 'oral_en': 'I report a parameter ratio. The literature shows the matched runtime measurements needed for a speed claim [5].', 'oral_zh': '我报告的是参数比；文献展示了速度主张所需的匹配运行测量 [5]。'}, 17: {'refs': [3], 'locator': 'PatchTST [3], Appendix A.6.2, Fig. 5, layers/width and ILI sensitivity.', 'en': 'PatchTST varies layers and hidden dimension and specifically finds ILI sensitive to those settings [3, App. A.6.2]. This is relevant evidence against dismissing tuning on a small influenza series. Our cross-model R² mixes architecture, optimisation and size; it is not a controlled capacity effect. A stronger follow-up varies depth/width within one family under a fixed training protocol and repeats runs. The planned MIFlu depth ladder begins this question, but its unaggregated status provides no scientific trend yet.', 'zh': 'PatchTST 改变层数和隐藏维度，并特别指出 ILI 对这些设置敏感 [3，附录 A.6.2]，这反对轻率否定小流感序列上的调参。我们的跨模型 R² 混合架构、优化和规模，不是受控容量作用。更强的后续是在一个家族内改变深度/宽度，固定训练协议并重复运行。MIFlu 深度阶梯开始提出这个问题，但未聚合状态不能提供科学趋势。', 'oral_en': 'Low cross-model R² does not dismiss tuning; PatchTST explicitly reports ILI sensitivity [3].', 'oral_zh': '跨模型 R² 低不能否定调参；PatchTST 明确报告 ILI 敏感性 [3]。'}, 18: {'refs': [20], 'locator': 'Demšar [20], §3.2.2 Post-hoc tests; local raw-p rank.', 'en': 'Demšar motivates controlling the comparison family when inspecting particular differences [20]. Here the first row keeps the substantive frontier question visible; the next six show smaller raw-p contrasts. All 136 still enter the correction. Rank 117 refers to ascending raw p, not a model’s accuracy rank. Choosing display rows cannot change that family. Because the article’s main setting is multiple datasets, it also does not licence treating our overlapping horizons and shared test series as independent datasets.', 'zh': 'Demšar 说明考查特定差异时须控制比较族 [20]。这里首行保留前沿核心问题，后六行展示原始 p 更小的对照，校正仍纳入全部 136 对。第 117 指原始 p 升序位置，不是模型精度排名。选择展示行不能改变检验族。该文主要讨论多数据集，也不许可把本地重叠跨度和共享测试序列当成独立数据集。', 'oral_en': 'The first row serves the research question; the full family still determines correction [20].', 'oral_zh': '首行服务研究问题，校正仍由完整检验族决定 [20]。'}, 19: {'refs': [20], 'locator': 'Demšar [20], §3.2.2 Holm step-down; local exact-enumeration derivation.', 'en': 'Demšar describes starting with the smallest p and stopping at the first failed Holm threshold [20]. Our first threshold is 0.05/136. The documented two-sided twelve-contribution sign-flip floor is 2/2^12; multiplying by 136 gives 0.06640625, so no pair can start the rejection sequence. This floor is local mathematical reasoning, not a result reported by Demšar for influenza. Holm permits dependence among valid p-values, but cannot repair invalid raw p-values from unjustified within-pair exchangeability. These are separate limitations.', 'zh': 'Demšar 说明 Holm 从最小 p 开始，在首次未通过阈值处停止 [20]。本项目第一阈值为 0.05/136；按已记录的十二贡献双侧符号翻转下限 2/2^12，乘 136 得 0.06640625，所以无法启动拒绝序列。这是本地数学推导，不是 Demšar 报告的流感结果。Holm 可处理有效 p 值之间的依赖，却不能修复因配对内部交换性不合理而无效的原始 p；两者是不同限制。', 'oral_en': 'The exact-test floor exceeds Holm’s first threshold; that is a design-resolution limit [20].', 'oral_zh': '精确检验下限超过 Holm 第一步阈值，这是设计分辨率限制 [20]。'}, 20: {'refs': [25], 'locator': 'Lakens [25], Introduction and Testing for Equivalence.', 'en': 'Lakens distinguishes a nonsignificant difference test from equivalence with prespecified meaningful bounds [25]. Thus p = 0.1172 does not answer whether NLinear’s observed extra error is acceptable for an application. Define that acceptable difference first, then use an uncertainty design respecting time/season dependence. Choosing a generous bound after seeing this table would not be convincing confirmation. Until then, observed error reduction, parameter ratio and inferential uncertainty should be reported together; the extra parameters cannot be dismissed as buying only noise.', 'zh': 'Lakens 区分不显著差异检验与预先规定有意义界限的等价检验 [25]。因此 p = 0.1172 没回答 NLinear 额外观测误差是否可接受。应先定义可接受差异，再采用尊重时间/季节依赖的不确定性设计。看表后才挑宽松界限，不能构成有说服力的确认。在此之前应并列报告观测降幅、参数比和推断不确定性，不能说额外参数只换来噪声。', 'oral_en': 'Non-rejection is not equivalence; the observed trade-off and unresolved inference coexist [25].', 'oral_zh': '未拒绝不等于等价，观测取舍与尚未解决的推断并存 [25]。'}, 21: {'refs': [6, 9], 'locator': 'Time-LLM [6], author abstract; Chronos [9], §3.', 'en': 'Time-LLM freezes its LLM but adds learned reprogramming and a prompt prefix [6]. Thus “frozen” alone does not define the same experiment as our feature/linear-readout pipeline. Chronos instead learns forecasting from numerical sequences [9]. These method differences justify keeping our negative finding narrow. To isolate a readout bottleneck, vary the readout/alignment while holding the encoder fixed; to isolate pretraining, compare matched pretrained and random backbones. Our eleven-arm result does not make those controlled separations.', 'zh': 'Time-LLM 也冻结 LLM，却加入可学习重编程和提示前缀 [6]，所以“冻结”不等同于本项目特征/线性读出流程。Chronos 则从数值序列学习预测 [9]。这些方法差异支持缩小负面结论。要分离读出瓶颈，应固定编码器后改变读出/对齐；要分离预训练作用，应比较匹配的预训练和随机骨干。十一模型结果没有完成这些受控分离。', 'oral_en': 'The failure concerns our feature/readout pipeline; Time-LLM and Chronos test other mechanisms [6, 9].', 'oral_zh': '失败限定本地特征/读出流程，Time-LLM 与 Chronos 检验其他机制 [6, 9]。'}, 22: {'refs': [24], 'locator': 'Vaswani et al. [24], §3.1 Decoder; local ForecastingLLM.forward and archived assertions.', 'en': 'The Transformer paper explains masking that prevents attention to subsequent positions [24, §3.1]. With the inspected ordering, time positions cannot acquire later text through these layers, and the head reads time positions. This is a structural argument about a fixed forward path, not certification of repository runtime or bitwise equality. The three archived assertions must control weights, inputs and evaluation randomness when comparing changed text and matched full/no-text outputs. The supplied JUnit now records three CPU assertions passed with zero skips; they were not rerun in this review. Independent training can consume randomness differently and requires its own test.', 'zh': 'Transformer 原文说明遮罩如何阻止关注后续位置 [24，第 3.1 节]。按已检查顺序，时间位置不能通过这些层取得后方文本，预测头又只读时间位置。这是固定前向路径的结构论证，不是仓库运行或逐位相等认证。三项归档断言须控制权重、输入和评估随机性，再比较更换文本及匹配完整/无文本输出，所附 JUnit 现记录三项 CPU 断言通过且零跳过；本次未重跑模型测试。独立训练可能不同地消耗随机数，须另测。', 'oral_en': 'Causal masking explains the inspected path; supplied CPU tests support fixed-weight equality [24].', 'oral_zh': '因果遮罩解释所查路径；回传 CPU 测试支持固定权重下相等 [24]。'}, 23: {'refs': [13], 'locator': 'Tan et al. [13], §3.2 Proposed Ablations, w/o LLM / LLM2Attn / LLM2Trsf.', 'en': 'Tan et al. remove or replace the LLM while retaining the surrounding trainable forecaster [13, §3.2]. This asks whether the backbone contributes beyond the wrapper. Our no-LoRA/depth variants address narrower adaptation/capacity questions; they do not automatically answer the same removal/replacement question or isolate text use. Queue completion is an operational status, and the returned queue records 60/60 DONE. Interpreting a scientific trend requires the reported variants’ scores, repeated-run variability and a matched protocol. The literature supplies an experimental question, not a result for our unaggregated ladder.', 'zh': 'Tan 等保留周边可训练预测器，移除或替换 LLM [13，第 3.2 节]，以检验骨干是否额外贡献信息。本地 no-LoRA/深度变体只回答较窄的适配/容量问题，不会自动回答同样的移除/替换问题，也不能分离文本使用。队列完成是操作状态，回传记录为 60/60 DONE；解释科学趋势需各报告变体分数、重复运行波动及匹配协议。文献提供实验问题，不提供本地尚未聚合阶梯的结果。', 'oral_en': 'The papers motivate removal/replacement controls; the unaggregated ladder has not answered those causal questions [13].', 'oral_zh': '文献支持移除/替换对照，尚未聚合阶梯尚未回答这些因果问题 [13]。'}, 24: {'refs': [4, 13, 14, 23], 'locator': 'Zeng et al. [4], §4; Tan et al. [13], §3.2; Qiu et al. [14], abstract and §§3–5 (preprint); Tashman [23], publisher-indexed abstract.', 'en': 'Simple-linear and LLM-removal critiques predate this project [4, 13]; Qiu et al.’s preprint reports conditional gains in larger cross-dataset settings [14]. Our narrower contribution connects audited influenza accuracy, peak endpoints, a cost subset and corrected inference. O1 checks persistence across origins/regions; Tashman motivates rolling-origin evaluation [23]. O2 adds validation-fitted height adjustment only if suitable prediction exports exist. A new mechanism cannot replace those checks or establish a universal verdict about LLM forecasting.', 'zh': '简单线性及移除 LLM 的批评早已存在 [4, 13]，Qiu 等预印本又在更大跨数据集设置报告条件式收益 [14]。本地较窄贡献连接经审计流感精度、峰值端点、代价子集和正确推断。O1 检查跨原点/区域是否保持，Tashman 支持滚动原点评测 [23]。O2 仅在预测导出合适时加入验证集拟合峰高调整；新增机制不能替代检查，也不能确立对所有 LLM 的判决。', 'oral_en': 'O1 tests the influenza-specific findings; prior negative and conditional-positive evidence rule out a universal conclusion [4, 13, 14].', 'oral_zh': 'O1 检验流感特定发现；已有负面和条件式正面证据，不支持通用结论 [4, 13, 14]。'}, 25: {'refs': [22], 'locator': 'Kapoor and Narayanan [22], model info sheets; EXECUTION_STATUS.md and NO_TEXT_VERIFICATION.md.', 'en': 'Kapoor and Narayanan ask for explicit reporting arguments rather than equating code availability with a valid result [22]. Here distinguish document rebuilding, CSV arithmetic, raw prediction rescoring and model retraining. A supervisor can begin with the historical CSV audit and then inspect the new returned raw predictions and run records. The supplied JUnit records the three named CPU assertions without skips; independent repetition still needs the pinned code and environment. The useful deliverable is a traceable evidence chain with exact commands and status. Passing one evidence level does not certify all the others.', 'zh': 'Kapoor 与 Narayanan 要求明确报告论证，而非把代码可用等同于结果有效 [22]。这里应分开文档重建、CSV 算术、原始预测重评分与模型重训。导师可先运行历史 CSV 审计，再核查新回传的原始预测和运行记录。所附 JUnit 记录三项 CPU 断言通过且零跳过；独立重复仍需固定代码与环境。有用的交付是可追溯证据链、精确命令与状态，某一层通过不能认证其他所有层。', 'oral_en': 'I distinguish recomputed results from static inspection and give the command and status for each [22].', 'oral_zh': '我区分重算结果与静态检查，并为每层提供命令和状态 [22]。'}}
def item(n,refs,locator,en,zh,oral_en,oral_zh):
 SUPPORT[n]=dict(refs=refs,locator=locator,en=en,zh=zh,oral_en=oral_en,oral_zh=oral_zh)
item(1,[13,5],
'Tan et al. [13], §3.3 Datasets and Evaluation Metrics; iTransformer [5], Appendix A.1.',
'Tan et al. explicitly use 70/10/20 for Illness [13, §3.3], while iTransformer preserves chronological separation [5, App. A.1]. These provide a concrete forecasting precedent: retain enough training data, use validation for model selection, and reserve later observations for the final test. The exact 676/97/193 integers come from our 966 rows and rounding rule. The literature supports the design rationale; it does not prove that this ratio is optimal for every influenza season or that our upstream file identity is established.',
'Tan 等明确对 Illness 使用 70/10/20 [13，第 3.3 节]，iTransformer 则保持按时间分离 [5，附录 A.1]。这是具体的预测研究先例：保留较多训练数据，以验证集选模，再用较晚观测做最终测试。676/97/193 的精确整数来自本项目 966 行及取整规则。文献支持设计理由，但不证明该比例对所有流感季最优，也不能证明本地文件与上游身份一致。',
'The split follows an Illness precedent in Tan et al.; chronological separation protects the final evaluation [13, 5].',
'这个划分有 Tan 等 Illness 实验的先例，时间分离用于保护最终评价 [13, 5]。')
item(2,[13],
'Tan et al. [13], §3.1 Reproducibility Note; local eval_windows.py.',
'Tan et al. retain original data-loaders and training conditions during their reproduction checks [13, §3.1]. This supports disclosing exactly which examples are scored; it does not require cropping. Our complete-batch rule changes the scoring population. Giving every model the same retained windows removes a comparison unfairness, but deleting the tail can still alter the result. The necessary sensitivity analysis is to score every model on all available windows and compare rankings. A literature citation cannot establish our discarded-tail difficulty without its raw calculation.',
'Tan 等复核时保留原数据加载器与训练条件 [13，第 3.1 节]，说明必须交代哪些样本进入计分，却不表示论文要求裁剪。本地完整批量规则改变了计分样本。各模型采用相同保留窗口，可消除比较不公平，但删去尾部仍可能改变结果。必要的敏感性分析是让所有模型在完整窗口重评分，再比较排名。文献不能代替被删尾部难度的原始计算。',
'Cropping preserves a shared scoring population; full-window rescoring tests its effect [13].',
'裁剪用于统一计分样本，完整窗口重评分用于检验裁剪影响 [13]。')
item(3,[22],
'Kapoor and Narayanan [22], Results, leakage taxonomy L1 and L1.2.',
'Kapoor and Narayanan identify preprocessing across the training/test boundary as a leakage route [22, L1.2]. Here that means fitting channel means and standard deviations only on training, then reusing them. If future observations determine these constants, preparation has already adapted to the held-out distribution even without using test labels in gradient updates. This makes train-only scaling part of the experiment. The separate local file-equality check establishes matching inputs, not absence of every possible leakage route.',
'Kapoor 与 Narayanan 把跨越训练/测试边界的预处理列为泄漏路径 [22，L1.2]。用于这里，就是只在训练段拟合各通道均值和标准差，再原样复用。如果未来观测决定这些常数，预处理已适应留出分布，即使梯度更新没有使用测试标签。因此训练段标准化属于实验设计。本地文件相等检查则只证明输入一致，不能证明所有泄漏路径均不存在。',
'Preprocessing is fitted on training only, following the leakage distinction in Kapoor and Narayanan [22].',
'依照 Kapoor 与 Narayanan 对泄漏的区分，预处理只在训练段拟合 [22]。')
item(4,[3,5,19],
'PatchTST [3], Appendix A.6.1; iTransformer [5], Appendix A.2 and Table 5; Bouthillier et al. [19], Appendix C.3.',
'The original three-seed citation is incorrect. PatchTST uses fixed-seed main results plus a five-seed supervised robustness check [3, App. A.6.1]; iTransformer reports five-run standard deviations [5, App. A.2, Table 5]. Neither passage establishes three seeds as their shared convention. Our choice is a compute compromise. Bouthillier et al. distinguish repeated-run precision from broader benchmark variation [19]. Extra seeds can improve the former; extra seasons/origins address different uncertainty. Ten reproduction repetitions do not make the separate three-seed benchmark equally precise.',
'原来的三种子引用不正确。PatchTST 的主结果采用固定种子，另做五种子监督稳健性检查 [3，附录 A.6.1]；iTransformer 报告五次运行的标准差 [5，附录 A.2 表 5]。这些段落不能证明三种子是两文共同惯例。我们的选择属于算力折衷。Bouthillier 等区分重复运行精度和更广的基准变异 [19]：增加种子可改善前者，增加季节/原点处理另一类不确定性。十次复现不会让独立的三种子基准同样精确。',
'Three seeds are our compute compromise. Both cited papers provide five-seed robustness evidence, motivating stronger checks [3, 5].',
'三种子是算力折衷；两篇所引论文实际提供五种子稳健性证据，提示仍需加强检查 [3, 5]。')
item(5,[22],
'Kapoor and Narayanan [22], taxonomy L1, clean separation through modelling and evaluation.',
'A checkpoint is a model-selection choice. Selecting it by test error uses the final evaluation to fit that choice, contrary to clean separation [22, L1]. This justifies our validation-selected checkpoint independently of whether a particular upstream bug can be proved. Scoring all seven declared channels is a separate metric-consistency issue. Neither principle proves Moon et al. committed the alleged defects or that exactly two changes caused our gap. Causal attribution needs matched runs changing checkpoint selection, loader or another factor one at a time.',
'检查点属于选模选择；按测试误差挑选，就是用最终评价拟合该选择，不符合干净分离 [22，L1]。不论上游缺陷是否能证实，这个原则都支持本地验证集选检查点。按声明的七通道计分则是另一项指标一致性问题。这些原则不能证明 Moon 等犯了所指缺陷，也不能证明差距仅由两项改变造成。因果归因需要配对运行，每次只改变检查点、加载器或另一项因素。',
'Validation selection protects the held-out test; upstream defect attribution is a separate evidence question [22].',
'验证集选模保护留出测试；上游是否有缺陷，须另有证据 [22]。')
item(6,[21,2],
'Hyndman and Koehler [21], §2.1; Kramer and Shaman [2], Forecast accuracy and comparison.',
'Hyndman and Koehler explain why measurement scale matters [21, §2.1]; Kramer and Shaman define peaks on an observed disease series [2]. Our standardised aggregate divides each channel’s squared error in original units by its training variance. The result is a dimensionless loss, not a patient-count curve with one inverse scaler. For peaks, inverse-transform ILITOTAL predictions and observations first, then locate peaks. Taking a peak of the seven-channel loss would answer a different question. Literature motivates an interpretable endpoint; ILITOTAL is our explicit operational choice.',
'Hyndman 与 Koehler 解释尺度为何重要 [21，第 2.1 节]；Kramer 与 Shaman 在观测疾病序列上定义峰值 [2]。本项目标准化总体损失将各通道原单位平方误差除以训练方差，所得是无量纲损失，而非可用一组参数反变换的患者人数曲线。峰值评测应先反变换 ILITOTAL 预测和观测，再找峰；对七通道损失找峰会回答另一个问题。文献支持可解释端点，ILITOTAL 是明确的项目选择。',
'Overall standardised error and an interpretable disease peak are different endpoints [21, 2].',
'标准化整体误差与可解释疾病峰值，是不同端点 [21, 2]。')
item(7,[19],
'Bouthillier et al. [19], §§2–3, benchmark estimators and sources of variation.',
'Bouthillier et al. show that benchmark estimates depend on the sampled learning pipeline [19]. A mean is therefore an estimate over specified runs, not an immutable property of a model name. Our two MIFlu estimates summarise separate seed sets and serve different comparisons. The gap could combine seed variability with configuration differences; it does not isolate one cause. Explain each table’s run definition first, then request matched run-level configurations if the cause of the difference matters.',
'Bouthillier 等说明基准估计取决于被抽样的学习流程 [19]。均值是指定运行集合的估计，不是模型名称自带的不变属性。两项 MIFlu 估计汇总不同种子集合，服务不同对照。差值可能同时包含种子波动与配置差异，不能分离某一原因。应先解释两表运行定义；若关心成因，再取回匹配的逐运行配置。',
'They estimate separate run sets; the difference is not a controlled effect of one change [19].',
'两数估计不同运行集合，不能把差值视为一项改变的受控效果 [19]。')
item(8,[21],
'Hyndman and Koehler [21], §2.1, MSE/MAE and sensitivity to large residuals.',
'The paper distinguishes squared and absolute errors and their sensitivity to large residuals [21]. As an algebraic illustration, not an observed run, doubling a residual doubles its absolute contribution but quadruples its squared contribution. A changed residual distribution can thus move MSE and MAE differently. Our CSV determines the actual horizon signs; the literature explains why different signs are possible. Per-channel and per-window residuals, rather than this general principle alone, are needed to identify the actual errors behind the gap.',
'该文区分平方与绝对误差，以及两者对大残差的敏感性 [21]。作代数示例而非实测：残差翻倍，绝对贡献变两倍，平方贡献变四倍。因此残差分布改变时，MSE 与 MAE 可以不同向。CSV 确定实际逐跨度符号，文献解释为何可能不同。若要确定哪些误差造成差距，仍需逐通道、逐窗口残差，不能只靠一般原理。',
'MSE weights large residuals more strongly than MAE, so the horizon signs must be read separately [21].',
'MSE 更重视大残差，逐跨度方向必须与 MAE 分开读取 [21]。')
item(9,[19,22],
'Bouthillier et al. [19], variance analysis; Kapoor and Narayanan [22], model info sheets.',
'Repeated-run estimates and traceable evaluation address different weaknesses [19, 22]. The oracle checks the arithmetic of a transcribed record; saved predictions would check whether the pipeline produced it. The practical chain is run configuration → prediction → scoring code → cell → aggregate. A benchmark plot is another summary and cannot establish a ten-seed reproduction trajectory. Missing links limit the claim even when the mean is close. The imported panels remain useful illustrations if their true provenance is stated.',
'重复运行估计与可追溯评测处理不同缺口 [19, 22]。oracle 核对转录记录的算术，保存预测才可核对流程是否产生该记录。实际链条是运行配置 → 预测 → 计分代码 → 单元 → 聚合。基准图是另一种摘要，不能建立十种子复现轨迹。即使均值接近，链条缺项仍限制主张；只要说明真实来源，沿用曲线仍可作示例。',
'The oracle establishes arithmetic; raw outputs establish provenance. Both evidence levels matter [19, 22].',
'oracle 建立算术证据，原始输出建立来源证据，两者都重要 [19, 22]。')
item(10,[4,3,5,7,8],
'Zeng et al. [4], §4; PatchTST [3], §3.1; iTransformer [5], §3; CALF [7] and TimeCMA [8], author abstracts.',
'The families test different explanations: simple temporal mapping [4], patches and inverted variable tokens [3, 5], and explicit cross-modal alignment [7, 8]. This motivates diverse controls, not a claim that 28 is an optimal count. It also makes implementation fidelity important: a named adaptation may omit a paper’s decisive alignment or training component. DLinear is a relevant simple control in this literature. Its appearance in the source paper is not itself a scientific reason to omit it from a sensitivity analysis.',
'各家族检验不同解释：简单时间映射 [4]、patch 与反转变量词元 [3, 5]，以及明确的跨模态对齐 [7, 8]。这支持采用多样对照，不证明 28 是最优数量，也使实现忠实度很重要：同名适配可能省略原文关键对齐或训练组件。DLinear 是这条文献中的相关简单对照；它曾出现在原论文，本身不是在敏感性分析中省略它的科学理由。',
'The papers motivate different controls; the exports determine which models each analysis actually covers [3–5, 7, 8].',
'论文支持选择不同对照；导出文件决定每项分析实际覆盖哪些模型 [3–5, 7, 8]。')
item(11,[2,18],
'Kramer and Shaman [2], Forecast accuracy and comparison; Bracher et al. [18], §§3–4.',
'Peak timing/intensity are disease-specific endpoints [2], while interval scoring evaluates predictive uncertainty [18]. A seven-channel point-error ranking supplies neither automatically. Separate observed accuracy, peak trade-offs and operational cost. NLinear’s lower height error does not erase its worse mean timing; MIFlu’s lowest MSE does not establish calibrated intervals or prospective benefit. This lets us defend an evidence-based selection process before claiming a public-health deployment winner.',
'峰值时间/强度是疾病领域端点 [2]，区间评分考查预测不确定性 [18]；七通道点误差排名不会自动提供这些证据。应分别看观测精度、峰值取舍与操作代价。NLinear 峰高误差低不能抹去平均时间误差更大；MIFlu 的 MSE 最低也不证明区间校准或前瞻效益。我们因此可先论证选模证据，再谈公共卫生部署赢家。',
'MIFlu wins the observed point-error ranking; peak endpoints and uncertainty need their own evidence [2, 18].',
'MIFlu 赢的是观测点误差排名，峰值端点与不确定性须有各自证据 [2, 18]。')
item(12,[2],
'Kramer and Shaman [2], Forecast accuracy and comparison, separate timing/intensity tolerances.',
'The separate literature endpoints motivate inspecting timing and height before reducing them to a pass count [2]. Our equal four-pass counts hide different lead/horizon locations and distances from the thresholds. An application emphasising one-week-ahead height could favour a different trade-off from an application emphasising timing. That conditional interpretation comes from our table, not from a literature recommendation of NLinear. A binary pass is a coarse summary of continuous errors.',
'文献分开评价时间与强度，支持先看两项误差，再压缩为通过数 [2]。相同四次通过隐藏不同步长/跨度位置，以及距阈值多远的差别。优先重视提前一周峰高的应用，可能与重视时间的应用选择不同取舍。这是对本地表格的条件式解释，不是文献推荐 NLinear。二元通过标签只是连续误差的粗略摘要。',
'Equal counts conceal different cells and a timing–height trade-off [2].',
'相同通过数隐藏不同位置与时间—峰高取舍 [2]。')
item(13,[2,18],
'Kramer and Shaman [2], Forecast accuracy and comparison / Fig. 2; Bracher et al. [18], §4.2.',
'Kramer and Shaman evaluate forecast-level peak accuracy by lead time [2]. Our sixteen configuration cells have a different denominator. Applying a threshold to an average is mathematically different from averaging event-level pass indicators. Thus 4/16 cannot be relabelled as season success probability. Bracher et al. discuss calibration of predictive distributions [18, §4.2]; small peak-height error does not establish it. Estimating event success requires retaining individual outcomes, defining the event denominator and accounting for dependence.',
'Kramer 与 Shaman 按提前时间评价逐预测峰值准确性 [2]，我们的十六个配置单元是另一种分母。对均值应用阈值，与对逐事件通过指示值取平均，在数学上不同，所以 4/16 不能改名为流行季成功概率。Bracher 等讨论预测分布校准 [18，第 4.2 节]，峰高误差小不等于已校准。估计事件成功率需保留逐事件结果、定义事件分母并处理依赖。',
'Our denominator counts configurations after averaging, not successful seasons or calibrated probabilities [2, 18].',
'这里数的是平均后的配置，而非成功流行季或经校准概率 [2, 18]。')
item(14,[4,21],
'Zeng et al. [4], §4 NLinear; Hyndman and Koehler [21], §2.1.',
'Zeng et al. describe NLinear’s last-value subtraction, linear map and addition back [4]. This gives a testable hypothesis about level handling, not a proven explanation for our peaks. The ranking mismatch itself follows a simpler distinction: MSE aggregates many points and seven channels, whereas PIE concentrates on detected ILITOTAL peak height [21 gives the error-measure context]. A model can improve many non-peak points yet worsen this endpoint. Controlled variants and peak/residual diagnostics are needed to attribute the observed trade-off to architecture.',
'Zeng 等说明 NLinear 先减最后一个值，经过线性映射，再加回该值 [4]。这提供水平处理的可检验假设，却非本地峰值成因的证明。排名差别有更直接的区别：MSE 聚合许多点和七通道，PIE 聚焦 ILITOTAL 检测峰高 [21 提供误差指标背景]。模型可能改善非峰点却使该端点较差。若要归因于架构，须有受控变体和峰值/残差诊断。',
'The objectives aggregate different errors; NLinear’s level correction is a hypothesis to test [4, 21].',
'两种目标聚合不同误差，NLinear 水平校正是待检验的假设 [4, 21]。')
item(15,[5],
'iTransformer [5], Appendix D Model Efficiency; local BENCH_EFFICIENCY.csv.',
'iTransformer evaluates error alongside speed and memory [5, App. D], a precedent for considering performance with cost. Our cost axis is narrower: exported parameters. The two local frontier members follow from pairwise dominance in the eleven-model subset, not a paper’s recommendation of a universal winner. A Pareto graph removes dominated choices; the remaining choices still need a budget or acceptable-error preference. Missing MIFlu cost data prevents calling it the frontier of all 28 models.',
'iTransformer 同时评价误差、速度和内存 [5，附录 D]，是把表现与代价并列考虑的先例。我们的代价轴更窄，只用导出参数。两个前沿成员来自十一模型子集的两两支配关系，并非论文推荐的通用赢家。Pareto 图排除被支配选择；余下选择仍需预算或可接受误差偏好。MIFlu 代价缺失，使它不能称为全部 28 模型前沿。',
'The frontier removes dominated choices within the measured subset; a decision preference still chooses among them [5].',
'前沿排除所测子集内的被支配选择，仍需决策偏好从中选模 [5]。')
item(16,[5],
'iTransformer [5], Appendix D, Fig. 10, matched speed/memory measurements.',
'iTransformer measures speed and memory under stated input/prediction lengths and the same batch size [5, App. D]. Our parameter export does not supply those measurements. Parameters affect storage; operations, token counts and hardware utilisation affect elapsed time differently. Consequently 211× parameters cannot imply 211× latency, memory or energy. A useful next efficiency table records hardware, precision, batch size and whether training or inference is timed. These fields cannot be invented from the parameter ratio.',
'iTransformer 在声明的输入/预测长度和统一批量下实测速度、内存 [5，附录 D]，我们的参数导出没有这些测量。参数影响存储，运算、词元数量与硬件利用率对耗时影响不同。因此参数多 211×，不能推出延迟、内存或能耗也多 211×。后续效率表应记录硬件、精度、批量，以及计时针对训练还是推理，不能用参数比猜这些字段。',
'I report a parameter ratio. The literature shows the matched runtime measurements needed for a speed claim [5].',
'我报告的是参数比；文献展示了速度主张所需的匹配运行测量 [5]。')
item(17,[3],
'PatchTST [3], Appendix A.6.2, Fig. 5, layers/width and ILI sensitivity.',
'PatchTST varies layers and hidden dimension and specifically finds ILI sensitive to those settings [3, App. A.6.2]. This is relevant evidence against dismissing tuning on a small influenza series. Our cross-model R² mixes architecture, optimisation and size; it is not a controlled capacity effect. A stronger follow-up varies depth/width within one family under a fixed training protocol and repeats runs. The planned MIFlu depth ladder begins this question, but its unaggregated status provides no scientific trend yet.',
'PatchTST 改变层数和隐藏维度，并特别指出 ILI 对这些设置敏感 [3，附录 A.6.2]，这反对轻率否定小流感序列上的调参。我们的跨模型 R² 混合架构、优化和规模，不是受控容量作用。更强的后续是在一个家族内改变深度/宽度，固定训练协议并重复运行。MIFlu 深度阶梯开始提出这个问题，但未聚合状态不能提供科学趋势。',
'Low cross-model R² does not dismiss tuning; PatchTST explicitly reports ILI sensitivity [3].',
'跨模型 R² 低不能否定调参；PatchTST 明确报告 ILI 敏感性 [3]。')
item(18,[20],
'Demšar [20], §3.2.2 Post-hoc tests; local raw-p rank.',
'Demšar motivates controlling the comparison family when inspecting particular differences [20]. Here the first row keeps the substantive frontier question visible; the next six show smaller raw-p contrasts. All 136 still enter the correction. Rank 117 refers to ascending raw p, not a model’s accuracy rank. Choosing display rows cannot change that family. Because the article’s main setting is multiple datasets, it also does not licence treating our overlapping horizons and shared test series as independent datasets.',
'Demšar 说明考查特定差异时须控制比较族 [20]。这里首行保留前沿核心问题，后六行展示原始 p 更小的对照，校正仍纳入全部 136 对。第 117 指原始 p 升序位置，不是模型精度排名。选择展示行不能改变检验族。该文主要讨论多数据集，也不许可把本地重叠跨度和共享测试序列当成独立数据集。',
'The first row serves the research question; the full family still determines correction [20].',
'首行服务研究问题，校正仍由完整检验族决定 [20]。')
item(19,[20],
'Demšar [20], §3.2.2 Holm step-down; local exact-enumeration derivation.',
'Demšar describes starting with the smallest p and stopping at the first failed Holm threshold [20]. Our first threshold is 0.05/136. The documented two-sided twelve-contribution sign-flip floor is 2/2^12; multiplying by 136 gives 0.06640625, so no pair can start the rejection sequence. This floor is local mathematical reasoning, not a result reported by Demšar for influenza. Holm permits dependence among valid p-values, but cannot repair invalid raw p-values from unjustified within-pair exchangeability. These are separate limitations.',
'Demšar 说明 Holm 从最小 p 开始，在首次未通过阈值处停止 [20]。本项目第一阈值为 0.05/136；按已记录的十二贡献双侧符号翻转下限 2/2^12，乘 136 得 0.06640625，所以无法启动拒绝序列。这是本地数学推导，不是 Demšar 报告的流感结果。Holm 可处理有效 p 值之间的依赖，却不能修复因配对内部交换性不合理而无效的原始 p；两者是不同限制。',
'The exact-test floor exceeds Holm’s first threshold; that is a design-resolution limit [20].',
'精确检验下限超过 Holm 第一步阈值，这是设计分辨率限制 [20]。')
item(20,[25],
'Lakens [25], Introduction and Testing for Equivalence.',
'Lakens distinguishes a nonsignificant difference test from equivalence with prespecified meaningful bounds [25]. Thus p = 0.1172 does not answer whether NLinear’s observed extra error is acceptable for an application. Define that acceptable difference first, then use an uncertainty design respecting time/season dependence. Choosing a generous bound after seeing this table would not be convincing confirmation. Until then, observed error reduction, parameter ratio and inferential uncertainty should be reported together; the extra parameters cannot be dismissed as buying only noise.',
'Lakens 区分不显著差异检验与预先规定有意义界限的等价检验 [25]。因此 p = 0.1172 没回答 NLinear 额外观测误差是否可接受。应先定义可接受差异，再采用尊重时间/季节依赖的不确定性设计。看表后才挑宽松界限，不能构成有说服力的确认。在此之前应并列报告观测降幅、参数比和推断不确定性，不能说额外参数只换来噪声。',
'Non-rejection is not equivalence; the observed trade-off and unresolved inference coexist [25].',
'未拒绝不等于等价，观测取舍与尚未解决的推断并存 [25]。')
item(21,[6,9],
'Time-LLM [6], author abstract; Chronos [9], §3.',
'Time-LLM freezes its LLM but adds learned reprogramming and a prompt prefix [6]. Thus “frozen” alone does not define the same experiment as our feature/linear-readout pipeline. Chronos instead learns forecasting from numerical sequences [9]. These method differences justify keeping our negative finding narrow. To isolate a readout bottleneck, vary the readout/alignment while holding the encoder fixed; to isolate pretraining, compare matched pretrained and random backbones. Our eleven-arm result does not make those controlled separations.',
'Time-LLM 也冻结 LLM，却加入可学习重编程和提示前缀 [6]，所以“冻结”不等同于本项目特征/线性读出流程。Chronos 则从数值序列学习预测 [9]。这些方法差异支持缩小负面结论。要分离读出瓶颈，应固定编码器后改变读出/对齐；要分离预训练作用，应比较匹配的预训练和随机骨干。十一模型结果没有完成这些受控分离。',
'The failure concerns our feature/readout pipeline; Time-LLM and Chronos test other mechanisms [6, 9].',
'失败限定本地特征/读出流程，Time-LLM 与 Chronos 检验其他机制 [6, 9]。')
item(22,[24],
'Vaswani et al. [24], §3.1 Decoder; local ForecastingLLM.forward and archived assertions.',
'The Transformer paper explains masking that prevents attention to subsequent positions [24, §3.1]. With the inspected ordering, time positions cannot acquire later text through these layers, and the head reads time positions. This is a structural argument about a fixed forward path, not certification of repository runtime or bitwise equality. The three archived assertions must control weights, inputs and evaluation randomness when comparing changed text and matched full/no-text outputs. The supplied JUnit now records three CPU assertions passed with zero skips; they were not rerun in this review. Independent training can consume randomness differently and requires its own test.',
'Transformer 原文说明遮罩如何阻止关注后续位置 [24，第 3.1 节]。按已检查顺序，时间位置不能通过这些层取得后方文本，预测头又只读时间位置。这是固定前向路径的结构论证，不是仓库运行或逐位相等认证。三项归档断言须控制权重、输入和评估随机性，再比较更换文本及匹配完整/无文本输出，所附 JUnit 现记录三项 CPU 断言通过且零跳过；本次未重跑模型测试。独立训练可能不同地消耗随机数，须另测。',
'Causal masking supports the structural argument; controlled runtime tests must establish bitwise equality here [24].',
'因果遮罩支持结构论证，本地逐位相等须由受控运行测试建立 [24]。')
item(23,[13],
'Tan et al. [13], §3.2 Proposed Ablations, w/o LLM / LLM2Attn / LLM2Trsf.',
'Tan et al. remove or replace the LLM while retaining the surrounding trainable forecaster [13, §3.2]. This asks whether the backbone contributes beyond the wrapper. Our no-LoRA/depth variants address narrower adaptation/capacity questions; they do not automatically answer the same removal/replacement question or isolate text use. Partial completion is an operational status. Interpreting a scientific trend requires the reported variants’ scores, repeated-run variability and a matched protocol. The literature supplies an experimental question, not a result for our unfinished ladder.',
'Tan 等保留周边可训练预测器，移除或替换 LLM [13，第 3.2 节]，以检验骨干是否额外贡献信息。本地 no-LoRA/深度变体只回答较窄的适配/容量问题，不会自动回答同样的移除/替换问题，也不能分离文本使用。部分完成是操作状态；解释科学趋势需各报告变体分数、重复运行波动及匹配协议。文献提供实验问题，不提供本地未完成阶梯的结果。',
'The papers motivate removal/replacement controls; the incomplete ladder has not answered those causal questions [13].',
'文献支持移除/替换对照，未完成阶梯尚未回答这些因果问题 [13]。')
item(24,[4,13,14,23],
'Zeng et al. [4], §4; Tan et al. [13], §3.2; Qiu et al. [14], abstract and §§3–5 (preprint); Tashman [23], publisher-indexed abstract.',
'Simple-linear and LLM-removal critiques predate this project [4, 13]; Qiu et al.’s preprint reports conditional gains in larger cross-dataset settings [14]. Our narrower contribution connects audited influenza accuracy, peak endpoints, a cost subset and corrected inference. O1 checks persistence across origins/regions; Tashman motivates rolling-origin evaluation [23]. O2 adds validation-fitted height adjustment only if suitable prediction exports exist. A new mechanism cannot replace those checks or establish a universal verdict about LLM forecasting.',
'简单线性及移除 LLM 的批评早已存在 [4, 13]，Qiu 等预印本又在更大跨数据集设置报告条件式收益 [14]。本地较窄贡献连接经审计流感精度、峰值端点、代价子集和正确推断。O1 检查跨原点/区域是否保持，Tashman 支持滚动原点评测 [23]。O2 仅在预测导出合适时加入验证集拟合峰高调整；新增机制不能替代检查，也不能确立对所有 LLM 的判决。',
'O1 tests the influenza-specific findings; prior negative and conditional-positive evidence rule out a universal conclusion [4, 13, 14].',
'O1 检验流感特定发现；已有负面和条件式正面证据，不支持通用结论 [4, 13, 14]。')
item(25,[22],
'Kapoor and Narayanan [22], model info sheets; EXECUTION_STATUS.md and NO_TEXT_VERIFICATION.md.',
'Kapoor and Narayanan ask for explicit reporting arguments rather than equating code availability with a valid result [22]. Here distinguish document rebuilding, CSV arithmetic, raw prediction rescoring and model retraining. A supervisor can begin with the CSV audit; the full bundle supports one raw-cell smoke check. Model text invariance needs the three named runtime assertions without skips in a pinned environment. The useful deliverable is a traceable evidence chain with exact commands and status. Passing one evidence level does not certify all the others.',
'Kapoor 与 Narayanan 要求明确报告论证，而非把代码可用等同于结果有效 [22]。这里应分开文档重建、CSV 算术、原始预测重评分与模型重训。导师可先运行 CSV 审计；完整包还支持一个原始单元 smoke 检查。模型文本不变性需在固定环境实际执行三项指定断言，且不能跳过。有用的交付是可追溯证据链、精确命令与状态，某一层通过不能认证其他所有层。',
'I distinguish recomputed results from static inspection and give the command and status for each [22].',
'我区分重算结果与静态检查，并为每层提供命令和状态 [22]。')
assert list(SUPPORT)==list(range(1,26))
